%% Title: MediSearch Deployment Architecture
flowchart TB
  Dev[Developer Workstation] --> GitHub[GitHub Repositories]
  GitHub --> VercelFE[Vercel Frontend Project]
  GitHub --> VercelBE[Vercel Backend Project]

  subgraph Edge[Vercel Edge Network]
    CDN[Global CDN]
    AngularBuild[Angular Static Build]
    Serverless[Node.js Serverless Functions]
  end

  subgraph ManagedData[Managed Data Services]
    MainNeon[(Neon Main PostgreSQL)]
    WarehouseNeon[(Neon Warehouse PostgreSQL)]
    Supabase[(Supabase Storage Landing Zone)]
    BackblazeRaw[(Backblaze B2 Raw Bucket)]
    BackblazeStage[(Backblaze B2 Staging Bucket)]
  end

  subgraph Operations[Operations]
    Env[Vercel Environment Variables]
    Secrets[CI/CD Secrets]
    Health[Health Checks]
    Logs[Runtime Logs]
  end

  VercelFE --> CDN --> AngularBuild
  VercelBE --> Serverless
  AngularBuild --> Serverless
  Serverless --> MainNeon
  Serverless --> Supabase
  Serverless --> BackblazeRaw
  BackblazeRaw --> BackblazeStage --> WarehouseNeon
  Env --> AngularBuild
  Env --> Serverless
  Secrets --> Env
  Serverless --> Logs --> Health
